    {
      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:song_vine",
      "text": [
        "A Pattern-weaver's song follows the stone. Song Vine is a tendril that crawls over the faces of blocks and carries redstone around corners, with no relay and no dust."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Growing it",
      "text": [
        "Right-click a solid face and the vine settles in the air against that face.",
        "Right-click an existing vine with another to add a second face in the same spot: floor and wall, or every side of a cube.",
        "Power drops by **one per step**, including where it wraps around a corner onto the next face. It speaks to Song Thread, song plates, vanilla dust and comparators.",
        "Break it, or the block it clings to, and you get back **one vine per face**. Relays still carry items; vines carry only the song."
      ]
    },
